<title>POLAND: Jelfa sees '97 net at PLN 24.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Jelfa sees '97 net at PLN 24.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish drug maker Jelfa SA expects to make a net profit of 24.4 million zlotys this year on a pre-tax profit of 35 million zlotys and sales of 187 million zlotys, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In the first 11 months of 1996 Jelfa earned 19.6 million zlotys on a pre-tax profit of 29.3 million zlotys and sales of 135.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>The statement said Jelfa's investments would reach 36 million zlotys this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
